{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>ושברתי</b> — for it was captured in the capture of Samaria." "<b>והכרתי</b> —בקעת און (Valley of Aven), a city name in Aram." "<b>ותומך שבט</b> — likeמטה עוז שבט (the staff of strength), to rule." "<b>קירה</b> — El-קיר (Kir), a city name in Assyria, and so it is written:ויגלם קירה (and I will exile them to Kirah)."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {3 "The Hebrew suffix in קירה may be a directional heh or part of the place name; translated the verse citation literally as it stands."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:17:42.242673765Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}